chezmoi dots upgrade — Run system and dotfile upgrade steps

USAGE
  chezmoi dots upgrade [<step>...] [options]

ARGUMENTS
  step  dotfiles, brew, apt, winget, uv, npm, psmodules (OS-specific).
  Default: all steps for this OS. Steps are arguments, not subcommands; execution follows the built-in plan order.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.
  --dry-run  show upgrade commands without executing upgrade steps (default: "false")

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).
  PATH  determines available package managers.

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots upgrade --dry-run
  chezmoi dots upgrade dotfiles uv
